----------
scriptunit-fragment 1
----------

var b = 1

----------
scriptunit-fragment 2
----------

set b = b + 1

----------
scriptunit-fragment 3
----------

set b = 10

----------
scriptunit-fragment 4
----------

let c = b + 5

----------
expect all four units are entered
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | compiles, runs | new | `b` = 10 |
| 2 | updates `b` (1) | compiles, runs | new | - |
| 3 | overwrites `b` (1) | compiles, runs | new | - |
| 4 | reads `b` (1) | compiles, runs | new | `c` = 15 |

----------
scriptunit-insert 5 after 1
----------

var b = 100

----------
expect a unit that shadows `b` is inserted after unit 1
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | reruns | rerun: units 2 and 3 wrote unit 1's `b` when they last ran, and now write unit 5's | `b` = 1 |
| 5 | - | compiles, runs | new | `b` = 10 |
| 2 | updates `b` (5) | reruns | its `b` is unit 5's now, of the same type | - |
| 3 | overwrites `b` (5) | reruns | its `b` is unit 5's now, another binding, though of the same type | - |
| 4 | reads `b` (5) | reruns | its `b` is unit 5's now, of the same type | `c` = 15 |
